  "text": "This all-black ensemble is a respectful and dignified choice for your grandfather's funeral. The simple black viscose long-sleeve top layers elegantly over the knee-length knit dress, creating a streamlined silhouette that honors the solemnity of the occasion while maintaining a timeless look. Your chosen accessories—the chunky beaded earrings with matching necklace, the wide wool scarf, and the block-heel Mary Janes—bring just enough texture and weight to ground the outfit without appearing flashy. The structured tote completes the practical yet polished look you need for the day.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Wear the #417·24 scarf loosely draped around your neck or tied slightly larger if it feels chilly in the morning air, ensuring it sits comfortably over the V-neck of the dress.",
    "The #102·33 shoes offer a stable and comfortable heel for walking during services, balancing the formal feel with everyday wearability."
  ],
